# Homebrew uses rolling releases, so the lockfile is not committed.
# https://github.com/Homebrew/homebrew-bundle#versions-and-lockfiles
#
# `brew bundle` writes this next to whichever Brewfile it is handed. That is normally
# the deployed copy under ~/.config/homebrew/ (covered by .chezmoiignore), but guard
# the source tree too in case a layer is ever run from here by hand.
dot_config/homebrew/Brewfile.lock.json
